  "title": "What is the HCBS Waiver Program?",
  "summary": "Discover the comprehensive range of Medicaid waiver programs available in Ohio designed to support older adults, people with disabilities, and youth with complex needs. Learn about eligibility requirements, services covered, and how these programs enable individuals to thrive in their own homes and communities. Dive into our friendly guide to find the right program for you or your loved one!",
